  "correction_rules": [
    "Bias correction: Model consistently underestimates prices in bullish sentiment periods (sentiment > 0.33), especially after recent lows or spikes.",
    "Lag correction: Forecast tends to lag true price movements by 1–3 days; adjust for immediate momentum in sentiment-driven rallies.",
    "Overshoot correction: After sharp price spikes, model overreacts and forecasts a peak that fails to correct — reduce forecast peak by 5–10% in subsequent days.",
    "Mean reversion bias: Model overcorrects downward after strong upward moves; apply a 2–3 day mean reversion filter to dampen extreme swings.",
    "Horizon-specific error: 30-day forecasts show persistent underestimation of price volatility in high-sentiment periods; increase forecast variance by 10–15% during sentiment > 0.33."
  ]
}
